# Theme Configuration

## Purpose

Provide a configurable terminal theme system with pre-built themes, preview capability, and custom RGB builder for the kudzu/torvox Android terminal emulator.

## Scope

This specification defines the theme system that replaces the hardcoded theme list with a flexible, user-configurable system.

